THAT VERIFIES YOUR WHEREABOUTS

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:06.885
AT A CERTAIN POINT IN TIME SO

00:09:06.886 --> 00:09:07.619
YOU HAVE AN ALIBI.

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:08.386
SO NO ONE CAN SAY YOU DID THIS

00:09:08.387 --> 00:09:10.956
TO ME AT THIS TIME.

00:09:10.957 --> 00:09:13.692
YOU LOOK      CAN LOOK AT THE RC

00:09:13.693 --> 00:09:13.725
YOU LOOK      CAN LOOK AT THE RI

00:09:13.726 --> 00:09:14.159
YOU LOOK      CAN LOOK AT THE RT

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:15.393
YOU LOOK      CAN LOOK AT THE R.

00:09:15.394 --> 00:09:16.962
I WAS AT THE 7-ELEVEN.

00:09:16.963 --> 00:09:18.196
&gt;&gt; Juan: WHAT HAPPENED WHEN

00:09:18.197 --> 00:09:19.764
YOU GAVE ME YOUR STARBUCKS CARD

00:09:19.765 --> 00:09:21.066
AND I USED IT?

00:09:21.067 --> 00:09:23.802
YOU ARE SETTING ME UP.

00:09:23.803 --> 00:09:25.971
[LAUGHTER]

00:09:25.972 --> 00:09:27.772
&gt;&gt; Greg: IF EVERYBODY WOULD DO

00:09:27.773 --> 00:09:29.407
THAT, EVERY CRIMINAL WOULD DO

00:09:29.408 --> 00:09:30.175
THAT.

00:09:30.176 --> 00:09:32.210
&gt;&gt; Jesse: I AM SAYING IT

00:09:32.211 --> 00:09:33.813
HELPS.

